# Build byproducts (never source, never a record; match anywhere). ".out"/".err"/".log" are
# deliberately omitted because SLURM emits them as record logs (slurm/logs*); they are ignored
# per-directory in the reference trees (docs/, literature/) instead. See docs/vision.md D17.
*.aux
*.blg
*.bcf
*.run.xml
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
*.idx
*.ind
*.ilg
*.thm

# Generated binaries / large data (never source, never a record; match anywhere)
*.pkl
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.mat
*.npy
*.npz
